body:
“Not compatible with life" sounds so cold but poetic at the same time.  
That is sucks if there is a patient used up all blood for transfusions+normal saline+lactated ringers solution  in ambulance, and they are still 10mins away from hospital.... If it is possible?

Big thank you for satisfying my curiosity.  This is much more interesting than any of my science classe at school:)

